<para id="RM000000DBF00JX" category="C" type-id="8007U" name-id="540JM-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>B2070/41</dtccode>
<dtcname>VSC Buzzer Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000DBF00JX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CV300000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>This DTC is output when a malfunction occurs in the skid control buzzer.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The buzzer sounding command from the seat belt control computer is sent to the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly via CAN communication, and the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly sounds the skid control buzzer.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
